    "source": "analytic",
    "note": "The cone (apex z = 30, 45 deg) is z = 30 - r. The box 20x20 (centred, z 0..10) gets the cone as its top: V = integral over the square of (30 - r) = 30*400 - (4 a^3/3)(sqrt 2 + asinh 1), a = 10."
